WEBVTT

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:32.496
in schools that we are present at
on a regular basis.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.856
When he says to the kids,
"When I was 11, I joined a gang.

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:38.776
When I was 14,
I murdered Mr. Khamisa's son.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:41.376
I've spent the last
umpteen years in prison.

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:44.456
I'm here to tell you: it's not worth it,"

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:47.096
do you think the kids
will listen to that voice?

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:49.656
Yes, because his intonations

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:52.976
will be of a person
that pulled the trigger.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:57.560
And I know that he wants
to turn the clock back.

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:00.136
Of course, that's not possible.